#: src-ru/data/events_slug.xml.rawclobber:159
#, fuzzy
msgid "data/events_slug.xml.rawclobber$//textList[@name=\"NOTHING_SLUG\"]/text[1]"
msgstr ""
"You arrive at the beacon and are relieved at the sight of open space. "
"Nebulas are terribly claustrophobic."

#: src-ru/data/events_slug.xml.rawclobber:160
#, fuzzy
msgid "data/events_slug.xml.rawclobber$//textList[@name=\"NOTHING_SLUG\"]/text[2]"
msgstr ""
"This beacon marks a 'small' gap in the nebula. No colonies or ships in "
"scanning distance."

#: src-ru/data/events_slug.xml.rawclobber:161
#, fuzzy
msgid "data/events_slug.xml.rawclobber$//textList[@name=\"NOTHING_SLUG\"]/text[3]"
msgstr ""
"You are relieved to see your sensors blink back on after the jump. No ships "
"detected."

#: src-ru/data/events_slug.xml.rawclobber:162
#, fuzzy
msgid "data/events_slug.xml.rawclobber$//textList[@name=\"NOTHING_SLUG\"]/text[4]"
msgstr ""
"The Slugs rely heavily on their telepathic powers and are reluctant to give "
"up that advantage by extending beyond nebulas. It's unlikely you'll "
"encounter any this far from the clouds."

#: src-ru/data/events_slug.xml.rawclobber:163
#, fuzzy
msgid "data/events_slug.xml.rawclobber$//textList[@name=\"NOTHING_SLUG\"]/text[5]"
msgstr ""
"You arrive in an area clear of nebula and quickly check to see if the "
"sensors are working. Everything is fine and no ships are detected in the "
"vicinity."

#: src-ru/data/events_slug.xml.rawclobber:177
#, fuzzy
msgid ""
"data/events_slug.xml.rawclobber$//textList[@name=\"NEBULA_NOTHING_SLUG\"]/text[1]"
msgstr ""
"When it comes to Slugs, no news is not necessarily good news. However, if "
"they are watching, they don't seem to want to confront you."

#: src-ru/data/events_slug.xml.rawclobber:178
#, fuzzy
msgid ""
"data/events_slug.xml.rawclobber$//textList[@name=\"NEBULA_NOTHING_SLUG\"]/text[2]"
msgstr ""
"It's not unusual to feel paranoia in a Slug controlled nebula, but for once,"
" it is unfounded."

#: src-ru/data/events_slug.xml.rawclobber:179
#, fuzzy
msgid ""
"data/events_slug.xml.rawclobber$//textList[@name=\"NEBULA_NOTHING_SLUG\"]/text[3]"
msgstr ""
"Either this part of Slug space is deserted, or it's too dense for even Slugs"
" to detect your presence. Time to move."

#: src-ru/data/events_slug.xml.rawclobber:180
#, fuzzy
msgid ""
"data/events_slug.xml.rawclobber$//textList[@name=\"NEBULA_NOTHING_SLUG\"]/text[4]"
msgstr ""
"This area of the nebula seems entirely empty until a small Slug transport "
"and its escorts emerges suddenly from through the clouds, only to disappear "
"again in a matter of seconds."

#: src-ru/data/events_slug.xml.rawclobber:181
#, fuzzy
msgid ""
"data/events_slug.xml.rawclobber$//textList[@name=\"NEBULA_NOTHING_SLUG\"]/text[5]"
msgstr ""
"You explore around the beacon and are shocked when a rock the size of a "
"small moon suddenly looms ahead of you. Scans reveal the solid-looking rock "
"is just a husk, almost entirely mined out of useful minerals."

#: src-ru/data/events_slug.xml.rawclobber:182
#, fuzzy
msgid ""
"data/events_slug.xml.rawclobber$//textList[@name=\"NEBULA_NOTHING_SLUG\"]/text[6]"
msgstr ""
"There are a number of small stations for travellers in the area, lit up by "
"guiding lights and advertisements. Only Slug ships are docked so you decide "
"it's better to avoid a confrontation and steer clear."

#: src-ru/data/events_slug.xml.rawclobber:193
#, fuzzy
msgid ""
"data/events_slug.xml.rawclobber$//textList[@name=\"NEBULA_STORE_SLUG\"]/text[1]"
msgstr ""
"A huge Slug teleports from nowhere onto the bridge! Before you can open "
"fire, he's spread his wares across the helm and is brandishing things at "
"you."

#: src-ru/data/events_slug.xml.rawclobber:194
#, fuzzy
msgid ""
"data/events_slug.xml.rawclobber$//textList[@name=\"NEBULA_STORE_SLUG\"]/text[2]"
msgstr ""
"You cautiously approach a Slug colony on a huge asteroid. It's a brave "
"person who sets foot on a Slug planet - it can take weeks to get the mucus "
"out of your clothes - but there's business to be done."

