#: src-ru/data/events_slug.xml.rawclobber:273
#, fuzzy
msgid "data/events_slug.xml.rawclobber$//event[@name=\"SLUG_FIGHT\"]/text"
msgstr ""
"It's rare for the Slugs to stay exposed in open space for long periods - the"
" ship here may be lost, or just passing through, but either way he moves in "
"to attack!"

#: src-ru/data/events_slug.xml.rawclobber:278
#, fuzzy
msgid "data/events_slug.xml.rawclobber$//event[@name=\"SLUG_MANTIS\"]/text"
msgstr ""
"You intercept comm chatter from an incoming Mantis ship. \"Look. This ship "
"appears not to be owned by the squishy ones. Maybe they won't smell so bad "
"when we cut them open.\" They move in on your position."

#: src-ru/data/events_slug.xml.rawclobber:287
#, fuzzy
msgid "data/events_slug.xml.rawclobber$//textList[@name=\"SLUG_PIRATE\"]/text[1]"
msgstr ""
"There appears to be a pirate ship nearby. Be on your guard; anyone trying to"
" hunt in Slug territory is either formidable or deeply stupid, and in space,"
" either can be dangerous."

#: src-ru/data/events_slug.xml.rawclobber:288
#, fuzzy
msgid "data/events_slug.xml.rawclobber$//textList[@name=\"SLUG_PIRATE\"]/text[2]"
msgstr ""
"\"We knew anyone foolish enough to try and sneak through a Slug nebula would"
" stick to open space. Yield your goods and we may let you live.\" You cut "
"the transmission in lieu of a response."

#: src-ru/data/events_slug.xml.rawclobber:289
#, fuzzy
msgid "data/events_slug.xml.rawclobber$//textList[@name=\"SLUG_PIRATE\"]/text[3]"
msgstr ""
"Before you can take a moment's rest from the ever present nebulas in this "
"sector, a pirate ship appears behind you and opens fire."

#: src-ru/data/events_slug.xml.rawclobber:298
#, fuzzy
msgid "data/events_slug.xml.rawclobber$//textList[@name=\"SLUG_REBEL\"]/text[1]"
msgstr ""
"As you arrive at the beacon, a hostile ship immediately registers on your "
"scanners. You didn't expect to see Rebels extending their reach into Slug "
"territory. Charge the weapons!"

#: src-ru/data/events_slug.xml.rawclobber:299
#, fuzzy
msgid "data/events_slug.xml.rawclobber$//textList[@name=\"SLUG_REBEL\"]/text[2]"
msgstr ""
"You jump into empty space and are relieved to see your sensors blink back to"
