"rebel ship on an approach vector!"

#: src-ru/data/events_slug.xml.rawclobber:300
#, fuzzy
msgid "data/events_slug.xml.rawclobber$//textList[@name=\"SLUG_REBEL\"]/text[3]"
msgstr ""
"You receive a message from a nearby ship, \"Looks like our intelligence was "
"correct! Sneaking through the clouds with the Slugs... No one can hide from "
"the rebellion!\""

